th></g></g></g></svg></div><div style=\"padding-top: 8px;\"> <div style=\" color:#3897f0; font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; font-style:normal; font-weight:550; line-height:18px;\">View this post on Instagram</div></div><div style=\"padding: 12.5% 0;\"></div> <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: row; margin-bottom: 14px; align-items: center;\"><div> <div style=\"background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 50%; height: 12.5px; width: 12.5px; transform: translateX(0px) translateY(7px);\"></div> <div style=\"background-color: #F4F4F4; height: 12.5px; transform: rotate(-45deg) translateX(3px) translateY(1px); width: 12.5px; flex-grow: 0; margin-right: 14px; margin-left: 2px;\"></div> <div style=\"background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 50%; height: 12.5px; width: 12.5px; transform: translateX(9px) translateY(-18px);\"></div></div><div style=\"margin-left: 8px;\"> <div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 50%; flex-grow: 0; height: 20px; width: 20px;\"></div> <div style=\" width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 2px solid transparent; border-left: 6px solid #f4f4f4; border-bottom: 2px solid transparent; transform: translateX(16px) translateY(-4px) rotate(30deg)\"></div></div><div style=\"margin-left: auto;\"> <div style=\" width: 0px; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-right: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(16px);\"></div> <div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; flex-grow: 0; height: 12px; width: 16px; transform: translateY(-4px);\"></div> <div style=\" width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-left: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(-4px) translateX(8px);\"></div></div></div> <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-grow: 1; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 24px;\"> <div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px; width: 224px;\"></div> <div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; width: 144px;\"></div></div></a><p style=\" color:#c9c8cd; font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:17px; margin-bottom:0; margin-top:8px; overflow:hidden; padding:8px 0 7px; text-align:center; text-overflow:ellipsis; white-space:nowrap;\"><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DeL4yMrgXV6/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" style=\" color:#c9c8cd; font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; font-style:normal; font-weight:normal; line-height:17px; text-decoration:none;\" target=\"_blank\">A post shared by WTA (@wta)</a></p></div></blockquote>\r\n<script async src=\"//www.instagram.com/embed.js\"></script></aside>\n</div><p>Gauff, the 2024 Beijing champion, delivered a flat performance, racking up 34 unforced errors in total. Eight of those were double faults, and four of those came as she dropped serve in the final game of the first set. Trailing 4-1 in the second set, Gauff told her team courtside that she had \"no energy\" and felt as though she would pass out.</p>\n<p>Mertens had also noticed this, but was taking nothing for granted -- especially having twice lost to Gauff after holding significant leads. Her hold for 4-1, in which she had navigated two deuces, had felt crucial.</p>\n<p><span data-olk-copy-source=\"MessageBody\">\"I kind of felt like she was dropping a bit in energy,\" Mertens said. \"I tried to push myself. But I know she's a great competitor. It's never done against her.\"</span></p>\n<p>The result is Mertens' 10th career Top 5 win, and her second of 2026 following her upset of Elena Rybakina in the Wimbledon third round. It's the third time in her career that she's scored multiple Top 5 wins in a single season -- in 2018, the Belgian defeated Elina Svitolina at the Australian Open and Sloane Stephens in Cincinnati; in 2021, she topped Svitolina again at the Gippsland Trophy in Melbourne, and Simona Halep in Madrid.</p>\n<p>Mertens advances to her second quarterfinal at WTA 1000 level or above this year, following her run to the last eight of Wimbledon. She'll take on another former winner, 2023 champion and No. 8 seed Iga Swiatek -- another player she has yet to defeat, though her 0-2 record against the Pole may seem less intimidating after finally getting over the Gauff hurdle. Mertens will be bidding to reach her first semifinal at WTA 1000 level or above since Dubai 2021.</p>",
